# ── project-21 DAILY LANE (BH-8079) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Once a day each box counts its builds of the last PROJECT_21_DAILY_WINDOW_H hours
# (the last `project-21 state=` line of each builds/*/pipeline.log) and raises one
# warn alert, id project-21-check-failing, when the project-21 check failed on more
# than PROJECT_21_DAILY_FAIL_PCT percent of them. It resolves the alert otherwise.
# Off: flags/lane-off-project-21-daily, or bin/harness-ctl.sh off project-21-daily.
41 6 * * * /root/harness/bin/project-21-daily.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
